flowchart TD
    SETUP[POST /interview/setup — validate role/category/difficulty/source]
      --> BANK[Bank mode: pick_questions → prepare_initial_turns\nSessionQuestion rows]
      --> AICREATE[AI mode: prepare_ai_first_question\nNVIDIA generation, validated/deduped, bank fallback]
      --> START[POST /interview/:id/start — status created → active]
      --> ROOM[Room — present current question]
      --> ANSWER[POST /interview/:id/answer — text answer or skip]
      --> EVAL[evaluate_submission — baseline_v1 + ai_v1 (if enabled) + ML (if enabled)]
      --> AI?
    AI? -- yes --> AGENT[advance_ai_interview — agent decide:\nFOLLOW_UP / CLARIFY / NEXT_QUESTION / FINISH]
    AI? -- no --> ADAPT[pick_adaptive_next — rule-based difficulty swap]
    AGENT -- FOLLOW_UP or CLARIFY --> INSERT[insert follow-up turn, present it]
    AGENT -- NEXT_QUESTION --> GENQ[append_next_ai_question — generate next main question]
    AGENT -- FINISH --> DONE[Finalize — compute_session_score → report]
    ADAPT --> GENQ
    INSERT --> ROOM
    GENQ --> ROOM
    ANSWER -- skip (AI mode) --> GENQ
    DONE --> REPORT[GET report / history]
    style EVAL fill:#7c3aed,color:#fff
    style AGENT fill:#2563eb,color:#fff
    style DONE fill:#059669,color:#fff
